<title>INDIA: Delhi share trade remains temporarily halted.</title>
<headline>Delhi share trade remains temporarily halted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Delhi Stock Exchange remained temporarily halted due to technical problems with its computer system, officials said.</p>
<p>They said trade failed to resume as scheduled at 1:15 p.m. (0745 GMT), but further attempts would be made.</p>
<p>When dealing stopped in the early afternoon, the exchange's benchmark index was up 1.29 points at 624.03.</p>
